# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is ignored by git: never commit keys.
# Nothing here is a paid key: the map is built with an open model on this machine and the prices
# come from Yahoo Finance (the yfinance library), which takes none.

# The SEC asks for a contact in the User-Agent: "market-hub-peers-map you@example.com".
# Only `make peers` uses it; the deploy does not need it.
SEC_USER_AGENT=

# Market Hub: with its address set, only people signed in there can use the tool (the hub's
# session secret comes from Secret Manager on deploy; locally set HUB_SESSION_SECRET too).
HUB_URL=https://themarkethub.app
